margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260331/202603312331076516.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260331/202603312331076516.jpg"> </div><p>世欧预附加赛决赛，意大利不敌波黑，无缘晋级2026美加墨世界杯，意大利连续3届世界杯无缘参赛！</p><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-01/match1944196date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">晋级世界杯！瑞典3-2波兰 约克雷斯88分钟绝杀制胜伊兰加建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260401/zhanbao_image_1944196_1774990065_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260401/zhanbao_image_1944196_1774990065_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260401/zhanbao_image_1944196_1774990065_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>瑞典时隔8年重回世界杯！约克雷斯绝杀，伊兰加，拉格比尔克建功。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-01/match1944197date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">时隔24年！土耳其1-0科索沃晋级世界杯正赛 阿克蒂尔克奥卢制胜球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" 