hot/images/share_match_image/20260401/zhanbao_image_1944198_1774992749_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>捷克加时2-2点球3-1丹麦，时隔20年重返世界杯！克雷伊奇加时建功，霍伊伦、德赖尔、延森失点，丹麦无缘世界杯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-01/match1871935date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">友谊赛-英格兰主场0-1不敌日本 三笘薰制胜球英格兰19射仅4射正</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260401/zhanbao_image_1871935_1774988875_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260401/zhanbao_image_1871935_1774988875_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260401/zhanbao_image_1871935_1774988875_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>日本队友谊赛两连胜！三笘薰抢断制胜，帕尔默被断送礼。</p><p><strong>【热门新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-01/69cbe89b32f36native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧洲区尘埃落定！世界杯48席已定46席：意大利连续3届无缘正赛！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.97" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260401/202604010545511604.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.97" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.97" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260401/202604010545511604.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260401/202604010545511604.jpg"> </div><p>北京时间4月1日凌晨，世预赛欧洲区预选赛附加赛的几场决赛已经全部结束，欧洲区世预赛结果也全部出炉。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-01/69cb0470a5d85native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">淘汰意大利！波黑时隔2届重回世界杯正赛 与加拿大卡塔尔瑞士同组</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260401/202604010541052728_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260401/202604010541052728_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260401/202604010541052728_720.jpg"> </div><p>世欧预附加赛决赛，意大利不敌波黑，再次无缘晋级2026美加墨世界杯。同时，波黑时隔两届重回世界杯，自2014年后再次登上世界杯舞台。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-01/69cc34207ac6enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无缘美加墨！27岁多纳鲁马4500万门将身价第一 至今没踢过世界杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260326/69c50049723b1.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1e